(ABSTRACT) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 g
62.3622047244094517 722.8348818897637784 Td
(Email remains the foundational communication protocol of global commerce, academia, and enterprise) Tj
T* (infrastructure, transmitting upwards of 340 billion messages daily. However, the foundational protocol underpinning) Tj
T* (email transmissionóthe Simple Mail Transfer Protocol \(SMTP, RFC 821/5321\)ówas designed in 1982 without) Tj
T* (built-in sender verification mechanisms. This architectural deficiency enables malicious adversaries to execute Email) Tj
T* (Spoofing, forging header fields to masquerade as trusted corporate executives, financial institutions, or university) Tj
T* (officials. According to the FBI Internet Crime Complaint Center \(IC3\), Business Email Compromise \(BEC\) and) Tj
T* (email spoofing account for over $2.9 billion in annual financial losses.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 g
62.3622047244094517 615.1183464566928478 Td
(Existing email security solutions, such as enterprise secure email gateways \(SEGs\), operate as costly, opaque) Tj
T* (black-boxes that quarantine messages without educating the recipient on why an email failed authentication. To) Tj
T* (bridge this critical usability and security divide, we have engineered SpoofSentryóan intelligent, browser-native,) Tj
T* (privacy-centric email spoofing and threat forensics web application. Built with React 19, TypeScript, and modern) Tj
T* (Web APIs, SpoofSentry provides transparent, explainable forensic evaluation without routing confidential internal) Tj
T* (emails through external third-party servers.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 g
62.3622047244094517 513.0711023622046696 Td
(SpoofSentry implements four multi-modal ingestion vectors: raw RFC 5322 header pasting, drag-and-drop .EML file) Tj
T* (parsing, mobile email screenshot OCR via Gemini Vision Multimodal AI, and direct Gmail OAuth inbox) Tj
T* (synchronization. The system parses folded headers, extracts Mail Transfer Agent \(MTA\) hops, queries authoritative) Tj
T* (DNS TXT records for SPF \(RFC 7208\), DKIM \(RFC 6376\), and DMARC \(RFC 7489\) policies, calculates hop transit) Tj
T* (latency anomalies, evaluates content urgency heuristics, and generates an explainable composite threat score \(0-100\)) Tj
T* (with actionable defense recommendations.) Tj
ET
