stream
0.5670000000000001 w
0.16 G
BT
/F10 13 Tf
18.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
62.3622047244094517 762.5199212598424765 Td
(INTRODUCTION) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 13 Tf
18.1999999999999993 TL
0. g
62.3622047244094517 739.8427559055118081 Td
(1 INTRODUCTION TO EMAIL FORENSICS & SPOOFING DETECTION) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 g
62.3622047244094517 717.1655905511811397 Td
(Email remains the indispensable communication backbone of modern civilization, connecting over 4.3 billion active) Tj
T* (users and processing in excess of 340 billion messages daily across financial networks, governmental institutions,) Tj
T* (corporations, and academic campuses. However, the foundational protocol governing internet message) Tj
T* (transmissionóthe Simple Mail Transfer Protocol \(SMTP\), originally standardized in RFC 821 in 1982 and) Tj
T* (modernized in RFC 5321ówas conceptualized during an era when the ARPANET consisted of a small community) Tj
T* (of trusted academic and military institutions. Consequently, SMTP inherently lacks intrinsic cryptographic primitives) Tj
T* (or identity verification mechanisms to authenticate the identity of the sending entity.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 g
62.3622047244094517 615.9687401574802834 Td
(This structural omission gives rise to the pervasive threat known as Email Spoofing. In an email spoofing attack, an) Tj
T* (adversary crafts malicious SMTP envelope and header directives to masquerade as a legitimate sender. Because mail) Tj
T* (user agents \(such as Apple Mail, Microsoft Outlook, or smartphone clients\) display only the human-readable "From") Tj
T* (header to the recipient, victims are readily deceived into believing that a communication originated from their) Tj
T* (company CEO, banking institution, or university administrator.) Tj
ET
BT
/F10 11.5 Tf
16.0999999999999979 TL
0.078 g
62.3622047244094517 540.8506299212598378 Td
(1.1 What is email spoofing and why is it dangerous?) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 g
62.3622047244094517 523.8427559055118081 Td
(Email spoofing represents the primary delivery vector for more than 91% of modern cyberattacks, serving as the) Tj
T* (technical foundation for spear-phishing campaigns, credential theft, ransomware dissemination, and Business Email) Tj
T* (Compromise \(BEC\). In a typical BEC exploit, attackers impersonate executive officers or trusted vendors to request) Tj
T* (fraudulent wire transfers, payroll diversion, or sensitive intellectual property disclosures. The FBI Internet Crime) Tj
T* (Complaint Center \(IC3\) reported over $2.9 billion in adjusted losses attributed to BEC in recent fiscal reporting,) Tj
T* (illustrating that spoofing is not merely a technical nuisance but a multi-billion dollar systemic cyber risk.) Tj
ET
BT
/F9 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 g
62.3622047244094517 435.6852755905511572 Td
(To combat this crisis, the security research community developed three foundational DNS-based cryptographic) Tj
T* (authentication standards: Sender Policy Framework \(SPF, RFC 7208\), DomainKeys Identified Mail \(DKIM, RFC) Tj
T* (6376\), and Domain-based Message Authentication, Reporting, and Conformance \(DMARC, RFC 7489\). While these) Tj
