(In this B.Tech mini-project, we have conceptualized, designed, implemented, and thoroughly evaluated) Tj
T* (SpoofSentryóan advanced, browser-native email spoofing forensic detector and threat analysis platform. The system) Tj
T* (successfully addresses the multi-billion dollar vulnerability of email impersonation and phishing by operationalizing) Tj
T* (the defensive principle: "Inspect. Verify. Defend.") Tj
ET
