/F9 10 Tf
14. TL
0.118 g
62.3622047244094517 662.1734645669291695 Td
(SpoofSentry departs fundamentally from opaque, centralized email security solutions by executing RFC 5322 header) Tj
T* (tokenization, Mail Transfer Agent \(MTA\) route traversal, and urgency heuristics directly inside client-side browser) Tj
T* (memory. By pairing local deterministic parsing with real-time DNS TXT cryptographic validation \(SPF RFC 7208,) Tj
T* (DKIM RFC 6376, DMARC RFC 7489\) and Gemini Vision AI for mobile screenshot OCR, the project delivers) Tj
T* (transparent, explainable forensic scores in under 350 milliseconds.) Tj
ET
